Q: How to print HTML content in angular8 project? A: <p>You can use:</p>
<pre><code>@media print {

 .section-to-hide-in-print {
    visibility: hidden;
 }

}
</code></pre>

Q: How to scroll down to specific option in a select element? A: <p>I created a fiddle for you.
<a href="https://jsfiddle.net/ci83rtda/wsx80aLf/22/" rel="nofollow noreferrer">This should help you.</a></p>

<p>HTML</p>

<pre><code>&lt;div id="container"&gt;
&lt;select name="" id="select"&gt;
    &lt;option value="1"&gt;item-1&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option value="2"&gt;item-2&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option value="3"&gt;item-3&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option value="4"&gt;item-4&lt;/option&gt;
